# 默认按文本处理（CRLF）；下面的二进制例外必须写在后面才能覆盖这一行，
# 否则图片/字体里的 0x0A 会被当成换行改写，文件损坏
* text working-tree-encoding=UTF-8 eol=crlf tabwidth=4
dist/**/* linguist-generated=true
*.user.js linguist-generated=true
*.jpg binary -working-tree-encoding -eol
*.png binary -working-tree-encoding -eol
*.gif binary -working-tree-encoding -eol
*.ttf binary -working-tree-encoding -eol
*.otf binary -working-tree-encoding -eol
*.woff binary -working-tree-encoding -eol
*.woff2 binary -working-tree-encoding -eol
*.eot binary -working-tree-encoding -eol